Chughtai et al. - 2025 - Whether Emotions are Engaging or Disengaging Depends on Relationship Functions.pdf

# SMB tombstones: deleted files the network share has not yet released.
# These keep the ORIGINAL file's contents under a new hidden name, so a
# name-based rule above will not catch them. Never commit these.
.smbdelete*

